      "content": "but even if i do those things, it doesn't change anything. the house is still empty. it's like i'm just a ghost wandering through a life that doesn't belong to me anymore. i feel so tired of fighting to stay in a world that feels so wrong without him. it feels almost selfish to keep forcing myself to endure this.",
